  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECFR MENA Analysis and political dialogue programme 21-24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting peacebuilding and diplomacy in the Middle East and North Africa. The progamme aims to support to advance peacebuilding channels and navigate change in the MENA region in a way that advances regional interests and bolsters a more efficient European peace making in the region. Mobilising extensive regional and European networks ECFR seeks to facilitate conflict resolution and stabilization goals; help reduce regional tensions; support inclusive governance and democratic development; and build effective European and MENA partnerships on security, political, economic and climate issues.</narrative>
  </description>
